# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# No framing: nothing embeds this app (the SDK's sign-in handoff is links, not
# iframes), and the public signing pages must not be framed — a page inside
# someone else's iframe can be overlaid to trick a click on "Submit
# signature" (clickjacking). Both headers, for browsers that know only one.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
